image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">One of my best picks on Seeking Alpha was Daqo Energy (DQ), a Chinese manufacturer of polysilicon photovoltaic products. I <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4104631-daqo-new-energy-the-lowest-cost-producers-will-survive\">first published</a> my thesis and buy recommendation in September 2017 @ $5.23 per share, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4223369-is-daqo-a-two-trick-pony\">re-iterated</a> the buy in November 2018 @ $4.71 per share, <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4325883-coronavirus-crisis-should-help-daqo-and-polysilicon-prices\">one more buy</a> in February 2020 @ $15.18 per share and finally <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vTdn8TjT3Fqy4XaYlxuwRvZy6opksmQ_f4YDRnvcPglWc37UNNUaLaYz4JesrMYknJz9ekkWM6PUpyz/pubhtml?gid=729780430&amp;single=true\">closed my position</a> in February 2021 @ $95.25.</figcaption></figure></div><p>This new pick fits that playbook.</p><p>It sells something the market treats like a box. But the company has built a supply chain and operating model that actually matters when the cycle turns:</p><ul><li><p>It runs at real scale, which helps it source components and execute when others can’t.</p></li><li><p>It reacts fast to mix and pricing, because it controls the customer relationship, not just the factory output.</p></li><li><p>It turns working capital into an advantage, collecting cash earlier and paying suppliers later.</p></li><li><p>It has a services and deployment engine that makes the “box” stickier than it looks on day one.</p></li></ul><p>I’m publishing the full investment thesis to paid subscribers soon.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you want to know the company's name and read the thesis, <strong>upgrade to paid</strong>. Below is the track record of my monthly picks.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p></p><div id=\"datawrapper-iframe\" class=\"datawrapper-wrap outer\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/Lz6Br/55/&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/981ddeb8-c1d3-4d76-85bf-89847b19edac_1220x1598.png&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url_full&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a11117c5-2147-4f67-a84a-751fa9f255aa_1220x1870.png&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:915,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Stock Pick Performance&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;These are the real-time scorecards for my stock picks. Returns are measured from the day I published them; open ones are unrealized. I only show annualized numbers after 30 days—short windows make those figures silly.&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"DatawrapperToDOM\"><iframe id=\"iframe-datawrapper\" class=\"datawrapper-iframe\" src=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/Lz6Br/55/\" width=\"730\" height=\"915\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe><script type=\"text/javascript\">!function(){\"use strict\";window.addEventListener(\"message\",(function(e){if(void 0!==e.data[\"datawrapper-height\"]){var t=document.querySelectorAll(\"iframe\");for(var a in e.data[\"datawrapper-height\"])for(var r=0;r<t.length;r++){if(t[r].contentWindow===e.source)t[r].style.height=e.data[\"datawrapper-height\"][a]+\"px\"}}}))}();</script></div><div><hr></div><h3>Trade alert:</h3><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png\" width=\"769\" height=\"39\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:39,&quot;width&quot;:769,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:4375,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/188905205?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_TFU!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc8a63955-f983-44c4-a9e1-d04a75e12036_769x39.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><ul><li><p>Buy DELL (3.5% of the portfolio)</p></li></ul><div><hr></div><p>Here’s the short version of why I like it:</p><ul><li><p><strong>It’s the operator play.</strong> Dell’s edge is execution: supply chain, pricing, mix, and delivery at scale. In a commodity-ish industry, that’s the moat.</p></li><li><p><strong>ISG is the profit engine.</strong> Infrastructure is where the operating income lives, and the AI server demand wave is pushing that segment back into growth.</p></li><li><p><strong>AI today, attach later.</strong> AI servers are low margin right now, but the strategy is footprint first, then higher-margin storage, networking, services, and support attach.</p></li><li><p><strong>The cash machine is real.</strong> Negative working capital and deferred revenue shrink invested capital, which lifts ROIC and supports aggressive capital returns.</p></li><li><p><strong>Shareholder returns are the plan.</strong> Dell targets returning a big chunk of adjusted free cash flow via buybacks and dividends, and the per-share math can compound fast if execution holds.</p></li></ul><p>More soon in the full deep dive.</p><p>~George</p>",
